# Wellrun UI

Before changing console, Discover, or any School UI, follow:

- `.cursor/skills/wellrun-ui/SKILL.md`
- `.cursor/skills/wellrun-brand/SKILL.md`

Use `BrandLogo` from `@wellrun/ui`. Do not duplicate controls. Forms need labels. Empty, loading, and error states must be specific. Prefer skeletons. Accessible semantics. Subtle motion that respects `prefers-reduced-motion`. Goal-based navigation. Consistency over novelty.
